WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:10.800
- All right, Coumarine City, here we come.
- Yay. Yay.

2
00:00:10.866 --> 00:00:12.933
- Wow, Serena's pumped up.
- Pika, pika.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.500
I guess you're all ready for the Pokémon Showcase, aren't you?

4
00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:21.433
You bet. I'm so totally excited, I can hardly wait to get there.

5
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:26.933
Oh, no. I'm so exhausted, I can hardly wait to sleep.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Isn't this hill ever going to end?

7
00:00:29.566 --> 00:00:33.500
- I was thinking the same thing.
- What are you two talking about?

8
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:37.166
- Serena, you were so psyched a minute ago.
- Pika.

9
00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:38.800
- Hey.
- Hm.

10
00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:41.800
From this point on, it's downhill all the way.

11
00:00:41.866 --> 00:00:44.466
- We're saved.
- What a relief.

12
00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:55.700
- Look. A Pokémon.
- Who's that?

13
00:00:55.766 --> 00:00:58.400
Hey, that's a Swanna.

14
00:00:58.466 --> 00:01:00.433
-Something's falling.

15
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.533
Aah...

16
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.333
-Huh?

17
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.433
Ash, no.

18
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

19
00:01:12.866 --> 00:01:14.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

20
00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:17.633
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

21
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

22
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:23.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

23
00:01:23.366 --> 00:01:26.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

24
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.433
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

25
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

26
00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:38.500
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

27
00:01:38.566 --> 00:01:40.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

28
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.933
A Slippery Encounter!

29
00:01:49.966 --> 00:01:53.866
As our heroes continue to make their way to Coumarine City,

30
00:01:53.933 --> 00:01:59.200
something unexpected has fallen from the sky, landing directly on Ash.

31
00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:04.566
It's all slimy! Uh...

32
00:02:07.266 --> 00:02:09.900
Is it a Pokémon?

33
00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:15.900
Goomy. The Soft Tissue Pokémon, and the weakest of all Dragon types.

34
00:02:15.966 --> 00:02:21.133
In order to keep its body moist, Goomy lives in places where it's dark and damp.

35
00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.200
Oh, wow.

36
00:02:22.266 --> 00:02:25.133
So Goomy's the weakest of all Dragon-type Pokémon.

37
00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.966
I've gotta say, it doesn't look like a Dragon type to me.

38
00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:32.633
- And something's not right.
- Hey. You OK?

39
00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.566
You know, the majority of Goomy's body is made up of liquid.

40
00:02:36.633 --> 00:02:39.133
I'm wondering if somehow it got dried out.

41
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.500
- I've got some water.
- Huh?

42
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.000
Goo.

43
00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:52.166
Maybe it's still not enough.

44
00:02:54.366 --> 00:02:57.866
- Ah! A river. Great.
- Huh?

45
00:02:57.933 --> 00:03:00.766
I'll just take it to the river.

46
00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:04.500
- Huh. You're gonna climb down there?
- It's too dangerous.

47
00:03:04.566 --> 00:03:07.266
We'll be fine. It's gotta have water.

48
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:08.600
- Uh...
- Pika!

49
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:10.100
- Oh!
- Pika!

50
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.333
Oh, no, Ash.

51
00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.833
- I've got you...
- Pika!

52
00:03:25.233 --> 00:03:27.500
- How was that?
- Pika!

53
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.766
- Pika. Pi.
- Go for it.

54
00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:34.166
Chu! Pika!

55
00:03:36.366 --> 00:03:38.000
- Thanks a lot, buddy.
- Pika.

56
00:03:40.666 --> 00:03:42.100
Almost there. Ah!

57
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:43.400
-Goomy!

58
00:03:43.466 --> 00:03:47.400
- Goomy! My! Goomy!
- Aah!

59
00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.333
Ash. We warned you.

60
00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.866
Goomy still looks weak...

61
00:03:58.933 --> 00:04:01.433
We've got to put more water on it.

62
00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.500
My. Goo.

63
00:04:04.566 --> 00:04:06.633
Goomy, hang in there.

64
00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.400
My. Goomy?

65
00:04:09.466 --> 00:04:11.333
How are you now?

66
00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.433
Mm!

67
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.500
My!

68
00:04:14.566 --> 00:04:17.966
- You're looking much better.
- My.

69
00:04:18.033 --> 00:04:20.433
- Goomy!
- That feel good?

70
00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.400
Goomy.

71
00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.333
Goomy!

72
00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:28.333
- Is that enough water for now?
- Goomy.

73
00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.266
- All right. That's such a relief.
- It sure is.

74
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:34.700
Yay, Goomy's better. Goomy's better.

75
00:04:34.766 --> 00:04:36.233
Denne-ne!

76
00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:43.533
-Huh? Goomy? Dedenne scares you?

77
00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:47.166
Well, it's possible Goomy's afraid because Dragon-type Pokémon

78
00:04:47.233 --> 00:04:50.533
- are weak against Fairy-type moves...
- Yeah, that makes sense.

79
00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.900
- Goomy!
- Huh?

80
00:04:51.966 --> 00:04:56.333
Wow. Goomy's scared of cute little Dedenne... You're weird.

81
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.433
Goomy. Goomy. Goomy.

82
00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.600
Goomy! Goomy!

83
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.866
That tickles. You're all jiggly. Stop.

84
00:05:04.933 --> 00:05:06.866
Goomy.

85
00:05:06.933 --> 00:05:08.500
Goomy, what's wrong?

86
00:05:08.566 --> 00:05:12.433
Goomy's horns have sensory organs, and I believe they're its weak point.

87
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.100
Slow down. Take it easy...

88
00:05:15.166 --> 00:05:18.333
Maybe when you said Goomy was weird, it hurt its feelings.

89
00:05:19.766 --> 00:05:21.600
-Goomy, Goomy, Goomy!

90
00:05:21.666 --> 00:05:24.166
It looks to me like Goomy thinks you're right.

91
00:05:24.233 --> 00:05:27.733
But it is a little gross that Goomy feels so slimy.

92
00:05:28.933 --> 00:05:30.466
- Huh?
- Hm?

93
00:05:30.533 --> 00:05:35.633
Goomy? I'm sorry. I hurt your feelings. Huh?

94
00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:39.433
How come it's only raining on Serena?

95
00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.033
- Whoa. You can use Rain Dance?
- Stop. I said I'm sorry.

96
00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:46.033
I won't call you gross again.

97
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.866
- Goomy.
- Huh?

98
00:05:48.866 --> 00:05:51.200
- It stopped.
- Hm?

99
00:05:51.266 --> 00:05:52.766
- Goomy.
- Now what's going on?

100
00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:55.500
Goomy looks just like you when you're hungry, Ash.

101
00:05:55.566 --> 00:05:58.833
Huh? Hey, Goomy, want something to eat?

102
00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.300
- Goomy.
- OK.

103
00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.200
- Huh?
- Goomy? Oh, man.

104
00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:07.066
- Goomy. Goomy.
- Where are you going?

105
00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:11.766
A Goomy, eh? Is it worth the catch?

106
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:14.466
A weak Pokémon like that can't be worth much.

107
00:06:14.533 --> 00:06:17.500
- I say let's stick to our plan.
- You mean catch Pikachu.

108
00:06:17.566 --> 00:06:19.833
- I'm with you.
- Wobba.

109
00:06:24.833 --> 00:06:26.766
Mm, mm, mm.

110
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:30.666
- Pika, pika.
- So Goomy likes to eat leaves, huh?

111
00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:34.500
- Goomy.
- Chespin. Che.

112
00:06:34.566 --> 00:06:37.200
- Whoa, Chespin. Not again.
- Che.

113
00:06:37.266 --> 00:06:39.733
- Huh?
- Chespin.

114
00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.766
- Are you hungry too?
- Pin.

115
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:44.266
Chespin!

116
00:06:47.266 --> 00:06:50.600
- Goomy!
- Che! Pin. Che. Che,

117
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:54.166
Chespin sure enjoys eating.

118
00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.833
Chespin, no.

119
00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.633
It looks really mad.

120
00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.533
Goomy.

121
00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:07.266
Of course. That tree must be Ariados's home.

122
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:09.133
Aria.

123
00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.366
-Electro Ball.

124
00:07:10.433 --> 00:07:13.600
- Pikachu! Ka!
- Ari!

125
00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.533
- Che!
- I'm so sorry.

126
00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.466
Uh, Chespin didn't mean any harm.

127
00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:20.100
- Please forgive us.
- Che.

128
00:07:21.233 --> 00:07:22.600
Chespin, pin.

129
00:07:22.666 --> 00:07:24.166
Ari.

130
00:07:25.533 --> 00:07:28.100
- Goomy.
- Aria.

131
00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:31.466
-Goomy, it's OK now. Huh?

132
00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:38.233
- Goomy's really scared.
- What's wrong? It's all over.

133
00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.000
- Goomy!
- Huh?

134
00:07:40.066 --> 00:07:42.266
- What do you mean?
- Ah!

135
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:46.833
It looks like it's all up to me now. The future is now, thanks to science.

136
00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.433
Clemontic Gear, on.

137
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:52.900
I thought we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one.

138
00:07:52.966 --> 00:07:55.166
I call it the Pokémon Translator Mark Two.

139
00:07:55.233 --> 00:07:58.766
It's the newest version of my Pokémon Translator,

140
00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:01.466
creating a visual image of what's actually happening

141
00:08:01.533 --> 00:08:03.333
inside of a Pokémon's brain.

142
00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:06.033
Whoa. Science is so amazing.

143
00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:10.333
- Is it safe?
- You just observe. Power on.

144
00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.833
I can see something.

145
00:08:46.366 --> 00:08:47.733
Oh.

146
00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:52.066
- Clemont, is that it?
- Uh... I'm really not sure.

147
00:08:52.133 --> 00:08:53.200
- Aah!
- Hm!

148
00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.600
You know what? I'm not surprised.

149
00:09:00.666 --> 00:09:04.766
I know the image was cut off, but I would theorise

150
00:09:04.833 --> 00:09:08.733
Goomy got caught up in some kind of Pokémon skirmish and ran away.

151
00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.033
Goo.

152
00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.633
Huh?

153
00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.533
Goomy! Goomy!

154
00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.566
Looks to me like Goomy says you're right.

155
00:09:15.633 --> 00:09:18.966
That's why Goomy was so scared when it saw the Ariados.

156
00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.433
- Huh?
- Goo, Goomy, goo?

157
00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.366
- Pi.
- Goo, Goomy.

158
00:09:25.433 --> 00:09:27.733
- What does Goomy want this time?
- Pika.

159
00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.033
Hey. What's going on?

160
00:09:37.933 --> 00:09:40.400
Prepare for trouble, we're going strong!

161
00:09:40.466 --> 00:09:42.733
And make it double, as the day is long!

162
00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.233
To protect the world from devastation!

163
00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.033
To unite all people within our nation!

164
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.000
To denounce the evils of veering off course!

165
00:09:51.066 --> 00:09:54.200
To catch Pikachu, we must come to the source!

166
00:09:54.266 --> 00:09:56.300
- Jessie!
- And James.

167
00:09:56.366 --> 00:09:59.633
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

168
00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.866
Surrender Pikachu now, or prepare for a fight!

169
00:10:02.933 --> 00:10:05.600
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

170
00:10:07.533 --> 00:10:09.766
Team Rocket. You guys again.

171
00:10:09.833 --> 00:10:12.466
Huh. Important work demands the best!

172
00:10:12.533 --> 00:10:14.700
- Meowth, do the rest!
- With zest!

173
00:10:17.966 --> 00:10:19.600
- Quick, Pikachu, Thunderbolt.
- Goomy!

174
00:10:19.666 --> 00:10:23.700
Pika! Pikachu!

175
00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.733
- Ah!
- Ha-ha.

176
00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:33.033
Our anti-zap twerp technology is second to none, son.

177
00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.633
Pika. Pi?

178
00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:39.566
- Pikachu, no.
- Pikachu!

179
00:10:39.633 --> 00:10:43.033
- Pikachu, yes.
- Here's your prize.

180
00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.800
- Team Rocket's got Goomy too.
- Huh?

181
00:10:51.866 --> 00:10:54.800
They must have gotten them both at the same time.

182
00:10:54.866 --> 00:10:58.366
They won't get away with it. No doubt we'll get them both back.

183
00:11:03.233 --> 00:11:04.966
- Froga.
- Quick, Frogadier,

184
00:11:05.033 --> 00:11:07.066
use Cut to slice through this thing.

185
00:11:08.033 --> 00:11:09.933
Dier.

186
00:11:12.433 --> 00:11:15.133
Fletchinder. I choose you.

187
00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.400
Fletch.

188
00:11:17.466 --> 00:11:20.800
Fletchinder, I need you to go and find Team Rocket's balloon.

189
00:11:20.866 --> 00:11:22.700
Fletchinder.

190
00:11:25.766 --> 00:11:28.433
Who's that Pokémon?

191
00:11:31.966 --> 00:11:34.366
It's Goomy.

192
00:11:34.433 --> 00:11:37.300
Goomy.

193
00:11:42.166 --> 00:11:44.400
Please, you're wasting energy.

194
00:11:44.466 --> 00:11:47.200
Right. Conserve. Be more responsible.

195
00:11:47.266 --> 00:11:51.466
Eek! There's a ghost standing behind Pikachu.

196
00:11:51.533 --> 00:11:54.066
- Pika.
- Goomy.

197
00:11:54.133 --> 00:11:57.200
- Nah, it's just Goomy.
- Don't scare me like that.

198
00:11:57.266 --> 00:11:59.366
Pikachu alone would have been quite enough,

199
00:11:59.433 --> 00:12:01.633
but there's always room for one more.

200
00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.633
And with those two trapped inside my anti-zap cage,

201
00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.400
Pikachu's helpless as an unplugged lamp.

202
00:12:07.466 --> 00:12:09.866
- Ha!
- Now it's merrily off to the Boss.

203
00:12:09.933 --> 00:12:12.600
- Right, but first...
- Partay!

204
00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.633
Wobba!

205
00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.333
Cheers.

206
00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.833
Wobba!

207
00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.200
- Yeah!

208
00:12:21.266 --> 00:12:22.633
- Meowth, you're next.
- Huh?

209
00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.300
- Oh. Yes, we're waiting.
- But I'm out of material.

210
00:12:26.366 --> 00:12:29.966
The writers left me high and dry. Hm.

211
00:12:30.033 --> 00:12:33.000
Yay! All right, now it's my turn.

212
00:12:34.366 --> 00:12:36.400
Mm., mm, mm, mm!

213
00:12:36.466 --> 00:12:41.266
- Lotad. What? No?
- Uh... Not today.

214
00:12:41.333 --> 00:12:44.266
- Oh!
- Now look, you bummed Jessie out.

215
00:12:44.333 --> 00:12:46.466
- Just kidding.
- Aaargh!

216
00:12:46.533 --> 00:12:49.666
Now it's time for my take on the Boss.

217
00:12:49.733 --> 00:12:52.666
"I'm certain the Pokémon catch will be important..."

218
00:12:52.733 --> 00:12:55.200
- Pika... Pika!
- Meowth, that's amazing.

219
00:12:55.266 --> 00:12:57.166
- Goomy.
- You sound just like him.

220
00:12:57.233 --> 00:12:58.700
Pika. Pika, pika!

221
00:12:58.766 --> 00:13:02.700
- Goomy?
- Pika! Pika!

222
00:13:02.766 --> 00:13:05.400
- Pikachu.
- Goo.

223
00:13:05.466 --> 00:13:06.600
Pika, pika!

224
00:13:06.666 --> 00:13:09.066
- Goomy!
- Pika!

225
00:13:09.133 --> 00:13:12.166
- Pika!
- Goomy!

226
00:13:12.233 --> 00:13:14.666
- Pika...
- Goomy.

227
00:13:14.733 --> 00:13:17.200
Pika, pika! Pika, pika!

228
00:13:17.266 --> 00:13:21.266
- Goo!
- Pikachu!

229
00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.866
Pika! Goo.

230
00:13:24.433 --> 00:13:26.833
- My, Goo!
- Pika! Pika!

231
00:13:28.433 --> 00:13:30.466
- Pika, pika?
- Goomy.

232
00:13:30.533 --> 00:13:32.833
- Goomy!
- Pika!

233
00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:39.033
- Pikachu! Pika, pika!
- Goomy!

234
00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.200
- Goo!
- Pika, pika!

235
00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.200
Goo!

236
00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:48.200
Goo.

237
00:13:48.266 --> 00:13:49.633
- Goo, Goo, Goo!
- Pika?

238
00:13:51.766 --> 00:13:53.866
Pika, pika!

239
00:13:53.933 --> 00:13:55.300
- Goomy!
- Pika, pika!

240
00:13:55.366 --> 00:13:58.866
- Something just went boom.
- A big bang boom.

241
00:13:58.933 --> 00:14:02.433
It sounded as loud as a whiny twerp.

242
00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.433
But everything seems to be in order...

243
00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.600
Hey! I don't remember Pikachu glistenin' like that.

244
00:14:08.666 --> 00:14:11.933
- My! Goo, goo, goo! Goomy.
- Pika, pika.

245
00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:16.100
Well, whatever. Let's get back to partying hardy.

246
00:14:16.166 --> 00:14:19.733
Yeah, partay!

247
00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.433
Goo.

248
00:14:22.666 --> 00:14:25.800
- My.
- Pi, Pikachu.

249
00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:27.433
My, my!

250
00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.166
- My.
- Pika, pika!

251
00:14:29.233 --> 00:14:31.166
Goo! My.

252
00:14:31.233 --> 00:14:33.433
Pikachu.

253
00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.433
You know, I've never seen Pikachu glisten like that before.

254
00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.433
Perhaps Pikachu perspires profusely.

255
00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:44.133
- That sweat'd work great in a magic trick.
