295
00:17:07.033 --> 00:17:09.233
Fletch! Fletch, fletch, fletch, fletch, fletch!

296
00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.933
- Pikachu! Pika!
- Fletch, fletch, fletch, fletch, fletch!

297
00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:13.933
- Huh?
- Hm?

298
00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.900
