314
00:17:57.633 --> 00:18:00.133
- Goomy!
- Ah!

315
00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:03.633
- Goomy!
- Goomy.

316
00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:05.633
- One more time.
- With more gusto.

317
00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.133
- Kaboo!
- Inkay!

318
00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.166
Run, Goomy.

319
00:18:14.733 --> 00:18:19.566
Goomy! My!

320
00:18:19.633 --> 00:18:22.366
Goomy!

321
00:18:22.433 --> 00:18:25.766
-Inkay!

322
00:18:27.566 --> 00:18:29.233
