- It used Bide.

323
00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.700
What do you know? Awesome, Goomy.

324
00:18:31.766 --> 00:18:33.033
Goomy.

325
00:18:35.766 --> 00:18:36.633
- Huh?
- Pika. Pi.

326
00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:39.400
- You're not confused any more.
- Fletch, Fletch.

327
00:18:39.466 --> 00:18:42.066
- Ugh! Shadow Ball, let's go.
- Ka!

328
00:18:42.133 --> 00:18:45.333
- All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.
- Pika!

329
00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:49.500
Pikachu!

330
00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:53.133
We're blasting off again!

331
00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.033
Wobbuffet!

332
00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.500
Inkay!

333
00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.066
- All right! Heh.
- Pikachu!

334
00:18:59.133 --> 00:19:02.366
- Goomy!
- You two were so amazing.

335
00:19:02.433 --> 00:19:04.466
Goomy!

336
00:19:06.933 --> 00:19:09.433
Hey, Goomy, that Bide of yours is totally cool.

337
00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.266
With that kind of awesome power, there's no way you could ever be weak.

338
00:19:13.333 --> 00:19:14.433
Pika, pika.

339
00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.433
Goo!

340
00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:17.766
- Ah!
- Denne-ne!

341
00:19:17.833 --> 00:19:20.066
- Huh?
- Goomy!

342
00:19:20.133 --> 00:19:22.733
Even if it is weak against Fairy types,

343
00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.933
there's no reason it should be that scared.

344
