- Goo!

365
00:20:33.466 --> 00:20:37.800
- That tickles. Come on.
- Goomy! Goomy!

366
00:20:37.866 --> 00:20:40.900
Ash has a new friend, Goomy has a new family,

367
00:20:40.966 --> 00:20:44.833
